silm:instances_papers_04_forge_sections_03_master_dag_concrete_anchor_3#d_mittens silm:hasLongDescription "The D_Mittens is In section 'The Forge Master Graph' the bare symbol RuntimeAtom anchors to D_Mittens: The colimit diagram D_Mittens: the typed functor J_Mittens to F_04 whose colimit is Mittens. Diagram legs include type-seed, evidence, measurement, quality, role, process, and trace." .
